		{"id":"road-title","type":"text","text":"# 🗺️ Roadmap\n\nProject status snapshot — 2026-05-20. Items grouped by phase; arrows show what unlocks what.","x":-680,"y":-560,"width":700,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"col-done","type":"text","text":"## ✅ Done\n\n- **AGT-01 יעל** — rewriter active\n- **AGT-02 יובל** — image designer active\n- **AGT-03 חן** — web researcher active\n- **AGT-04 גיא** — QA gatekeeper active\n- **CEO contract** — `.claude/agents/ceo/agent.md` (v1.0)\n- **QA loop** — 3-round protocol enforced\n- **gpt-image-gen** skill — curl + base64 + verify\n- **obsidian-vault-workflow** skill — read/write protocol\n- **Vault structure** — Meeting Notes + _index.md\n- **chen/Memory dedup** — 30-day TTL heuristic\n- **End-to-end test** — `2026-05-19-ai-news.md` shipped\n- **Superpowers SessionStart hook** — bootstrapping active","x":-800,"y":-380,"width":380,"height":600,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"col-progress","type":"text","text":"## 🔄 In Progress\n\n- **yael/style-guide.md** — empty placeholder; needs author voice + examples\n- **Hebrew↔English routing** — works but edge cases (mixed-input) untested\n- **Vault session-log discipline** — protocol exists, enforcement is soft\n- **chen/Memory size** — log growing; no pruning yet\n- **End-to-end image flow** — verified once, needs more reps","x":-380,"y":-380,"width":380,"height":600,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"col-next","type":"text","text":"## ➡️ Next\n\n- **Trim `CLAUDE.md`** — move workflows to `.claude/workflows/`, leave a pointer\n- **Prune Superpowers skills** — drop TDD, debugging, worktrees, code-review (not content-relevant)\n- **AGT-05 Brief Intake** — clarifying-question agent that returns structured JSON brief\n- **Auto-commit `Stop` hook** — git commit + optional push for `Output/`, `Content/`, `vault/`\n- **Vault-update enforcement hook** — `Stop` audit that a vault entry was written\n- **Resolve plugin/skill duplicates** — `superpowers:*` vs project-local `.claude/skills/*`","x":40,"y":-380,"width":380,"height":600,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"col-later","type":"text","text":"## 🔮 Later\n\n- **AGT-06 Distribution** — adapt MD/HTML to Twitter thread, LinkedIn post, newsletter\n- **AGT-07 Fact-Check** — verify rewrite claims against original source\n- **Asset Manager** — channel-specific image variants (OG, hero, thumbnail)\n- **Translator/Localizer** — dedicated agent with glossaries (when multi-language scales)\n- **chen/Memory compaction** — periodic summarization of old entries\n- **Style-guide ingestion** — convert sample texts → style rules automatically\n- **Telemetry** — track per-pipeline cost (tokens, OpenAI image calls)","x":460,"y":-380,"width":380,"height":600,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"legend","type":"text","text":"### 🎨 Color legend\n\n- 🟢 Done\n- 🟡 In Progress\n- 🔵 Next (this/next session)\n- 🟣 Later (when needs arise)\n\n### ⚠️ Known risks\n\n1. **Empty style guide** blocks ❌ on QA category 2 silently — currently passes by skip\n2. **No fact-check** — hallucinated stats/quotes can ship\n3. **CLAUDE.md bloat** — every task pays the context cost","x":-800,"y":280,"width":600,"height":320,"color":"1"}
